SUMMARY:Live Music and Food Truck Night at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Night in Davis Friday\, August 21 | 5–8:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick off your weekend with an evening of live music\, authentic Mexican food\, and award-winning wine at Great Bear Vineyards!\nGather your friends\, pour a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine\, and relax among the vines while enjoying live music from Marty Cohen & The Sidekicks. Maiz Mexican Food will be serving up their delicious menu from 5–8:30 PM\, with live music from 6–7:30 PM.\n Music by Marty Cohen & The Sidekicks\nWe’re excited to welcome Marty Cohen & The Sidekicks back to the winery! Featuring Marty Cohen\, Ken Rabiroff\, and Jeff Sears\, this talented trio is one of Northern California’s premier acoustic vocal groups. Their rich three-part harmonies\, distinctive arrangements\, and blend of folk-inspired originals with pop influences create the perfect soundtrack for a relaxing summer evening.\n Food by Maiz Mexican Food\nCome hungry! This family-owned food truck serves authentic Mexican favorites\, including tacos\, huaraches\, quesadillas\, and more\, all featuring their signature smoked meats and fresh\, flavorful ingredients. It’s the perfect pairing with a glass of Great Bear wine.\n Your Evening Includes A glass of Great Bear estate-grown wine Live music by Marty Cohen & The Sidekicks (6–7:30 PM) Authentic Mexican food available for purchase (5–8:30 PM) Beautiful vineyard views and a relaxing summer atmosphere\nPlease help us support this wonderful local food truck by purchasing your dinner onsite and leaving outside food at home.\nGreat wine\, delicious food\, live music\, and beautiful vineyard views—it’s everything you need for the perfect Friday night. We can’t wait to see you at the vineyard!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-and-food-truck-night-at-great-bear-vineyards-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled-OoIRnT.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
