SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard in Davis Every Saturday Morning August 22 | 9–10 AMYoga Class Ticket: $10Start your weekend with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views at Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard!Whether you’re brand new to yoga or simply looking for a relaxing way to ease into your Saturday\, this welcoming outdoor class is designed for all experience levels. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals of yoga with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement to help you build confidence\, improve flexibility\, and leave feeling refreshed.Set among the peaceful surroundings of Great Bear Vineyards\, it’s the perfect opportunity to slow down\, reconnect with yourself\, and enjoy a little tranquility before the weekend begins. What to Bring Yoga mat Water bottle TowelBreathe deeply\, stretch gently\, and start your weekend feeling your very best. We can’t wait to welcome you to the vineyard!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/beginner-yoga-at-the-vineyard-5/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
